The tests make ~10^5 single-element thrust::device_vector writes; each is a small pageable copy,
~19 us on SCALE (MI210) vs ~5.6 us on NVIDIA (RTX 4070 Ti), so tests run in parallel by meson
exceed its 30 s timeout.
hashinator segfaults/timeouts: https://code.spectralcompute.com/spectral-compute/scale/issues/1218
